SUMMARY:Dulles: 52-minute connection
LOCATION:Washington Dulles (IAD)
DESCRIPTION:No customs here. Walk or take the AeroTrain to the UA 803 gate
 . Look up the gate in the app before landing.\nThe long day
END:VEVENT
