DTSTART:20261209T172000Z
DTEND:20261210T075000Z
SUMMARY:UA 803 Dulles → Haneda
DESCRIPTION:Boeing 777-200\, 14 h 30. Stay awake for the first half\, slee
 p the second half. Lands 16:50 Japan time on Thu Dec 10.\nThe long day
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Boarding soon: UA 803 Dulles → Haneda
TRIGGER:-PT75M
END:VALARM
