BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:jt26-d1-0@japan26-trip
DTSTAMP:20261113T174614Z
DTSTART:20261210T075000Z
DTEND:20261210T090000Z
SUMMARY:Land at Haneda Terminal 3
LOCATION:Haneda Airport Terminal 3
DESCRIPTION:Immigration and customs with your Visit Japan Web QR codes; al
 low 45–75 min. Pull ¥30\,000 each from the 7-Bank ATM in arrivals.\nDa
 y 1: Land\, eat\, sleep
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:jt26-d1-1@japan26-trip
DTSTAMP:20261113T174614Z
DTSTART:20261210T090000Z
DTEND:20261210T101500Z
SUMMARY:Suica\, then into the city
DESCRIPTION:Moziah and AJ: Suica in Apple Wallet. Trenton: try adding Suic
 a to Google Wallet; global Pixels usually can't\, so buy a Welcome Suica 
 card at T3. Then the Limousine Bus (≈ ¥1\,400) or Keikyū + JR (≈ ¥
 550).\n≈ ¥550–1\,400\nDay 1: Land\, eat\, sleep
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:jt26-d1-2@japan26-trip
DTSTAMP:20261113T174614Z
DTSTART:20261210T101500Z
DTEND:20261210T110000Z
SUMMARY:Check in at Hotel Gracery Shinjuku
LOCATION:Hotel Gracery Shinjuku
DESCRIPTION:Lobby on 8F of the Godzilla-head building. Shower.\nDay 1: Lan
 d\, eat\, sleep
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:jt26-d1-3@japan26-trip
DTSTAMP:20261113T174614Z
DTSTART:20261210T110000Z
DTEND:20261210T123000Z
SUMMARY:Omoide Yokochō
LOCATION:Omoide Yokochō
DESCRIPTION:The smoky yakitori alley by the West Exit. Skewers and beers a
 t a counter. Cash is easiest; small places add a seating charge.\n≈ ¥3
 \,000–4\,500\nDay 1: Land\, eat\, sleep
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:jt26-d1-4@japan26-trip
DTSTAMP:20261113T174614Z
DTSTART:20261210T123000Z
DTEND:20261210T140000Z
SUMMARY:Ramen\, konbini run\, bed
LOCATION:Ichiran Shinjuku
DESCRIPTION:Ichiran is 24 h and painless for a first night. Grab tomorrow'
 s breakfast at a 7-Eleven. Bed by 22:30 to beat jet lag.\n≈ ¥1\,100–
 1\,500\nDay 1: Land\, eat\, sleep
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:jt26-d2-0@japan26-trip
DTSTAMP:20261113T174614Z
DTSTART:20261210T223000Z
DTEND:20261210T225500Z
