UID:jt26-d2-1@japan26-trip
DTSTAMP:20261113T174614Z
DTSTART:20261210T225500Z
DTEND:20261211T013000Z
SUMMARY:Graze Tsukiji Outer Market
LOCATION:Tsukiji Outer Market
DESCRIPTION:Tuna bowls\, grilled scallops\, tamagoyaki\, wagyu skewers. Mo
 st stalls wind down by 13:00.\n≈ ¥2\,500–4\,000\nDay 2: Market\, dig
 ital art\, Shibuya from above
END:VEVENT
