LOCATION:teamLab Borderless
DESCRIPTION:Azabudai Hills. Hibiya Line Tsukiji → Kamiyachō\, 10 min. A
 llow 2 hours. Dynamic pricing; a Friday sits above the base price.\nfrom 
 ¥3\,400\nDay 2: Market\, digital art\, Shibuya from above
BEGIN:VALARM
