SUMMARY:Shibuya
LOCATION:Shibuya Scramble Crossing
DESCRIPTION:Hibiya Line to Ebisu\, JR one stop (20 min). Scramble crossing
 \, Miyashita Park\, Parco\, Don Quijote.\n≈ ¥400\nDay 2: Market\, digi
 tal art\, Shibuya from above
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:jt26-d2-5@japan26-trip
DTSTAMP:20261113T174614Z
DTSTART:20261211T064000Z
DTEND:20261211T093000Z
SUMMARY:Shibuya Sky at sunset
LOCATION:Shibuya Sky
DESCRIPTION:Enter before sunset\, watch the city light up\, look for Mt Fu
 ji to the west. No time limit once in. No bags\, hats or tripods on the r
 oof (lockers on floor 46).\n¥3\,400 online\nDay 2: Market\, digital art\
 , Shibuya from above
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Leave in 20 min: Shibuya Sky at sunset
TRIGGER:-PT30M
