DTSTAMP:20261113T174614Z
DTSTART:20261212T013000Z
DTEND:20261212T040000Z
SUMMARY:Ueno → Ameyoko
LOCATION:Ameyoko
DESCRIPTION:JR Yamanote\, Shinjuku → Ueno\, 25 min. Market street under 
 the tracks: street food\, sneakers\, cheap sashimi bowls\, standing bars 
 open from late morning.\ntrain ≈ ¥210–230 · food ≈ ¥1\,500–2\,
 500\nDay 3: Send the bags\, old Tokyo\, big night
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:jt26-d3-2@japan26-trip
DTSTAMP:20261113T174614Z
DTSTART:20261212T040000Z
DTEND:20261212T070000Z
SUMMARY:Akihabara
LOCATION:Akihabara Electric Town
DESCRIPTION:Two stops. Arcades\, retro games\, multi-floor electronics. Gi
 ve AJ and Moziah an hour to disappear.\nDay 3: Send the bags\, old Tokyo\
 , big night
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:jt26-d3-4@japan26-trip
