DTSTART:20261212T080000Z
DTEND:20261212T100000Z
SUMMARY:Marunouchi illuminations
LOCATION:Marunouchi Naka-dori
DESCRIPTION:Walk Naka-dōri from Tokyo Station; the restored station build
 ing is lit at night.\nfree\nDay 3: Send the bags\, old Tokyo\, big night
END:VEVENT
