UID:jt26-d3-5@japan26-trip
DTSTAMP:20261113T174614Z
DTSTART:20261212T100000Z
DTEND:20261212T130000Z
SUMMARY:Izakaya dinner
LOCATION:Ebisu Yokochō
DESCRIPTION:Torikizoku (every item about ¥390) for cheap and loud\, or a 
 kushikatsu or sashimi place. Then Ebisu Yokochō or back to Kabukichō.\n
 ≈ ¥3\,500–6\,000\nDay 3: Send the bags\, old Tokyo\, big night
END:VEVENT
