SUMMARY:Hokuriku Shinkansen → Nagano
DESCRIPTION:Buy an ekiben (station bento) for breakfast on board. Sit on t
 he left for mountain views past Takasaki.\n¥8\,340 · bento ≈ ¥1\,200
 \nDay 4: Monkeys in the hot spring\, then your own
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Leave in 20 min: Hokuriku Shinkansen → Nagano
TRIGGER:-PT20M
